### Title
Search v3.whl packages on monolithic repodata channels

### Why
Searching wasn't working on monolithic repodata channels. Since the only production channel (conda-pypi) is sharded only, this test ensures that users can create local channels with wheel packages successfully.

### Platforms
- [X] Windows
- [X] macOS
- [X] Linux

### Prerequisites
- Latest canary conda
- conda-pypi >= 0.12.0

### Steps
1. pip download --dest mychannel/noarch pyfig
1. conda pypi index mychannel
1. conda search --override-channels -c file:///mychannel pyfig

### Pass criteria
1. conda search finds pyfig

